1. By way of this Special Criminal Application under Article 226 & 227 of the Constitution of India read with section 482 of the Cr.P.C., the petitioner has approached this Court for the following reliefs:-
"8(A) YOUR LORDSHIPS may be pleased to quash and set-aside First Information Report dated 16.06.2021 registered before Mahila Police Station, Gir Somnath being FIR no. 11186010210016 of 2021 and all its consequential proceedings;
(B) Pending notice, admission and final hearing of the present petition, YOUR LORDSHIPS be pleased to stay further investigation/proceedings in First Information Report dated 16.06.2021 registered before Mahila Police Station, Gir Somnath being FIR no. 11186010210016 of 2021 and all its consequential proceedings;
Sandipgiri S/O Kailashgiri (Petition ... vs State Of Gujarat on 11 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/27628539/
1 (C) Be pleased to pass any other order in interest of justice."
